msgid "Beside the study"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A few things are written in the study's own folder, because they belong "
"to it:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"the files a room sends you, fetched by their digest, in ``.em_cache`` at "
"the root of the project;"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"the local copies freed from the project when the master is safe "
"elsewhere, put aside in ``.em_freed`` with the date, rather than deleted;"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"the ``.3tz`` packed from a tileset folder, beside the folder (*desktop "
"only*)."
msgstr ""

